    LLM: 'Ante. Stage 1: 2 cards, declare yes/no (best high 2-card). Stage 2: 3 community cards, yes/no (best LOW 5-card). Stage 3: 2 more hole cards, yes/no (best HIGH 5-card of 7). Single yes=1 token. Multiple yes=show hands, loser pays pot-sized side bet to winner.',
